CLASS pu net/minecraft/world/entity/ai/goal/GoalSelector$InternalGoal
	COMMENT this was later renamed to WrappedGoal but exists in LCE/Bedrock as InternalGoal.
	COMMENT also Mojang seems to not know how to use internal classes properly knowing they probably should be static to not generate fake this$0 field
	FIELD a goal Lps;
	FIELD b priority I
	FIELD c this$0 Lpt;
	METHOD <init> (Lpt;ILps;)V
		ARG 1 this$0
		ARG 2 priority
		ARG 3 goal
